// ⚪ EXTRA · [▶ Watch](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3VcKaXpzqRo) · Sub: swap to *sub: Lateral Raise, Cable* [▶ video](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lq7eLC30b9w)
// Slight forward lean, lead with the elbows, stop at shoulder height. Light weight, no swinging.
extra: Lateral Raise, Dumbbell / 3x12 6kg 60s / warmup: none / progress: dp(1kg, 12, 15)

// ⚪ SUB for Lateral Raise · [▶ Watch](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lq7eLC30b9w) · Hidden. Pick *sub: Lateral Raise, Cable* after Swap Exercise. One arm at a time, lean away from the stack.
sub: Lateral Raise, Cable / 3x12 7.5kg 60s / warmup: none / used: none / progress: dp(1kg, 12, 15)

// ⚪ EXTRA · [▶ Watch](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_t3lrPI6Ns4) · Sub: swap to *sub: Shrug, Barbell* [▶ video](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M_MjF5Nm_h4)
