extra: Shrug, Dumbbell / 3x10 22kg 60s / warmup: none / progress: dp(2kg, 10, 15)

// ⚪ SUB for Shrug · [▶ Watch](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M_MjF5Nm_h4) · Hidden. Pick *sub: Shrug, Barbell* after Swap Exercise. Total including the bar. Smith machine is fine.
