## Day B

// 🟢 MAIN · [▶ Watch](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5CECBjd7HLQ) · Sub: swap to *sub: Incline Bench Press, Smith Machine* [▶ video](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8urE8Z8AMQ4)
